-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Clear the reserved seed id ranges first, so a regenerated seed cannot
-- leave rows from a previous generation behind. `chapters` and
-- `story_genres` carry no real foreign key to `stories` (MySQL ignores the
-- inline column-level REFERENCES in V1), so they must be deleted explicitly.
-- Nothing outside these prefixes is touched.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
